# DESK06 probe -- open the File drop-down so the `Execute EmuCON` row can be
# measured (the geometry dump itself is printed at boot by desk06_patch.py).
# Hovering a title is enough to open its drop-down (no click), as in DESK05.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 88 8
2200 mark B_FILEMENU
